/P 69 0 R
/T (Issuers are now structural buyers of T-bills. BIS research finds a USD 3.5bn inflow into dollar stablecoins lowers 3-month T-bill yields by up to about 4bps within ten days, roughly double that under Treasury market stress. The same channel can run in reverse in a redemption wave.)
/E (Issuers are now structural buyers of T-bills. BIS research finds a USD 3.5bn inflow into dollar stablecoins lowers 3-month T-bill yields by up to about 4bps within ten days, roughly double that under Treasury market stress. The same channel can run in reverse in a redemption wave.)
