/S /H5
/P 73 0 R
/T (The GENIUS Act \(Guiding and Establishing National Innovation for US Stablecoins Act\), signed into law in July 2025, gives payment stablecoins in the United States a far more credible monetary framework. Through a licensing regime, transparency requirements, AML/KYC obligations, strict reserve rules and a ban on paying interest, it aims to turn the dollar peg from a marketing promise into an enforceable claim.)
/E (The GENIUS Act \(Guiding and Establishing National Innovation for US Stablecoins Act\), signed into law in July 2025, gives payment stablecoins in the United States a far more credible monetary framework. Through a licensing regime, transparency requirements, AML/KYC obligations, strict reserve rules and a ban on paying interest, it aims to turn the dollar peg from a marketing promise into an enforceable claim.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
