1487 0 obj
<<
/Title (Stablecoins are becoming private digital money. Built on crypto rails, a fiat-backed stablecoin is tokenised private money, only as credible as its issuer's balance sheet, the liquidity of its reserves and the strength of its redemption promise.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1212 0 R
/Prev 1352 0 R
/Next 1568 0 R
>>
