1490 0 obj
<<
/Title (From trading tool to a new form of privately issued digital money.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1354 0 R
/Next 1571 0 R
>>
endobj
1491 0 obj
<<
/Title (Stablecoin supply has expanded, regulators are now building dedicated legal frameworks around them, and the question has shifted. Stablecoins are no longer just a crypto-market convenience. They are becoming a new form of privately issued digital money, with real consequences for payment systems, Treasury markets, bank deposits and, eventually, the transmission of monetary policy.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1354 0 R
/Prev 1571 0 R
/First 1572 0 R
/Last 1572 0 R
/Count -1
>>
