/Title (The risks are just as real, and they are not new ones dressed up in new language. Private money is fragile when redemption depends on confidence. Safe assets can turn unstable when everyone tries to sell them at once. Monetary sovereignty erodes when a foreign unit of account becomes more convenient than the domestic one.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1214 0 R
/Prev 1358 0 R
/Next 1359 0 R
