1598 0 obj
<<
/Title (The evidence supports the mechanism. In BIS Working Paper 1270, a USD 3.5bn \(two-standard-deviation\) inflow into dollar-backed stablecoins lowers 3-month T-bill yields by 0.71bps on impact and by up to about 4bps within ten days, with little spillover to longer maturities. The effect roughly doubles to 8 to 10bps when Treasury market intermediaries are under stress, and has grown as the sector has scaled. There is also a geopolitical dimension: dollar tokens can extend demand for US safe assets to users who have never opened a US brokerage account.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1575 0 R
/Prev 1626 0 R
/First 1627 0 R
/Last 1627 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
