/Title (The GENIUS Act \(Guiding and Establishing National Innovation for US Stablecoins Act\), signed into law in July 2025, gives payment stablecoins in the United States a far more credible monetary framework. Through a licensing regime, transparency requirements, AML/KYC obligations, strict reserve rules and a ban on paying interest, it aims to turn the dollar peg from a marketing promise into an enforceable claim.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1624 0 R
/First 1676 0 R
/Last 1676 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 1652 0 R
>>
endobj
1652 0 obj
<<
