/Title (Stablecoins blend features that used to belong to separate kinds of money. Like cash, they move peer-to-peer and settle almost instantly. Like bank deposits, they work at a distance, across borders and time zones. But unlike deposits, they do not depend on the same banking intermediation chain.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1649 0 R
/Next 1673 0 R
>>
